  "stock_source": "function %load_at_0_and_add(i64 vmctx) -> i64 system_v {\n    gv0 = vmctx\n    gv1 = load.i64 notrap aligned gv0\n\nblock0(v0: i64):\n    v1 = load.i64 notrap aligned v0\n    v3 = iconst.i64 1\n    v2 = iadd v1, v3  ; v3 = 1\n    return v2\n}\n",
